<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="lo">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ - NEOPLAY SHOP</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Phetsarath OT', sans-serif, Arial;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #dbeafe;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .login-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }
        .title {
            color: #1e40af;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .subtitle a {
            color: #2563eb;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            color: #1f2937;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .form-group label span {
            color: #ef4444;
        }
        .form-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border: 1px solid #93c5fd;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background-color: #f0f7ff;
            font-size: 15px;
            outline: none;
        }
        .form-group input:focus {
            border-color: #2563eb;
            background-color: #fff;
        }
        .checkbox-group {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #374151;
        }
        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            background: #3b82f6;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="login-card">
        <div class="title">➡️ ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ</div>
        <div class="subtitle">
            ລູກຄ້າຍັງບໍ່ມີບັນຊີ? <a href="#">ສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ</a>
        </div>

        <form>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ <span>*</span></label>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Username">
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ <span>*</span></label>
                <input type="password" placeholder="***********">
            </div>

            <div class="checkbox-group">
                <input type="checkbox" id="remember">
                <label for="remember">ຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຕະຫຼອດ</label>
            </div>

            <button type="button" class="btn-submit">ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ</button>
        </form>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
